"screen, whichever screen the user is on.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Camera-frames","level":3,"text":"Camera frames"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Frames are delivered on a background queue by "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/newsdk-public.NewSDK\/documentation\/NewSDK\/VideoCapture","type":"reference"},{"text":" (or, for the old CIN front, by the camera feed manager).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A thread-safe flag makes sure only one frame at a time is being recognised; the rest are dropped.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Time-outs","anchor":"Time-outs","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The recto screens time out after about 27 seconds (90 seconds on iPhone 6 \/ 7 class devices) and the new CIN verso"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after 27 seconds; the old CIN verso has no time-out. The new CIN front also asks the user to use an original card when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no valid card has been recognised after 7 seconds."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/newsdk-public.NewSDK\/documentation\/NewSDK\/ScanFlow","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/newsdk-public.NewSDK\/documentation\/NewSDK"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://newsdk-public.NewSDK/documentation/NewSDK/ViewControllerNewCinVerso":{"url":"\/documentation\/newsdk\/viewcontrollernewcinverso","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Second screen of the new-CIN flow: scans the verso (back) of the card with ML Kit text recognition.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"ViewControllerNewCinVerso","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ViewControllerNewCinVerso","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/newsdk-public.NewSDK\/documentation\/NewSDK\/ViewControllerNewCinVerso","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","ki